  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-056 (Phase 3 — engine / Network (`HFRNetwork`) — transport, endpoints, sessions, raw fetchers): Image hosts: rehost client (key and base URL injected; legacy key reused for now, ADR 0007) + host adapter table (Referer for reho.st, keyless hosts, http-only hosts).\n\n### Scope\n\nImage hosts: rehost client (key and base URL injected; legacy key reused for now, ADR 0007) + host adapter table (Referer for reho.st, keyless hosts, http-only hosts)\n\n- Module: HFRNetwork · Difficulty: easy · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: D10\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-012 (#45)\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-056-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#84](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/84) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-reho-st-image-fetched-cookie-less (#134)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `todo`.\n",
